---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Interest Group — Alma-Sophia Merscher"
  description="An international interest group for researchers working on loneliness."
>
  <section class="wrap page">
    <p class="eyebrow">Interest Group</p>
    <h1>An international group for loneliness researchers</h1>

    <div class="prose">
      <p class="lead">
        I started this group in 2023 when I slowly shifted into loneliness research. In my
        view, it can be incredibly helpful to get together with other researchers from time
        to time and talk and discuss whatever research or methodological question or
        proposal idea we have in mind.
      </p>

      <h2>Who it is for</h2>
      <p>
        If you are interested in topics revolving around loneliness or related areas, you
        are very welcome to join us, no matter what career stage you are at.
      </p>

      <h2>How it works</h2>
      <p>
        We currently meet irregularly and every session looks a bit different. This is
        really for the ones who show up, who can just sit in and listen or actively engage
        in discussions.
      </p>

      <h2>Joining</h2>
      <p>
        Feel free to just send me a short{" "}
        <a href="mailto:a.merscher@lmu.de">email</a> voicing your interest.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .page {
    padding: 3rem 1.5rem 4rem;
    max-width: 680px;
  }
  .eyebrow {
    color: var(--accent-rust-deep);
  }
  h1 {
    font-size: 2.1rem;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }
  .prose {
    line-height: 1.75;
  }
  .prose p {
    margin: 0 0 1.2rem;
  }
  .lead {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }
  .prose h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin: 2.2rem 0 0.6rem;
  }
</style>
